
/* A general purpose monster. Clone this object,
 * and call local functions to configure it.
 *
 * Hacked so agressive monsters don't auto-attack really wimpy
 * characters.
 * 
 * Use the monsterer to create monsters unless you know
 * what you're doing -- Dredd.
 */

/*
 * 940212 Hunter     shifted Bonding variable to add_store(). General tidy up.
 *                   shifted string info to add_store(). 
 * 950203 Ormuzd - added set_can_wander() and query_can_wander().
 * 950515 Qarath - put a quick hack debug code into stop badly coded
 *		   monster_died() routines. Logs all potential infinate loops
 * 950727 Ormuzd - added setup_commands() to allow NPC to use their race/guild souls.
 * 950822 Jenna  - added wield_best_weapon() to allow NPCs to use the best
 *		   weapon in their possession.	
 *		 - added query_NPC() fun to allow easy detection of which
 *		   monsters are not controlled by a player
 * 960804 G - nonagressive in any room marked `npc_non_aggressive' or `city'
 * 960805 G - monster skills set to averages * assigned level.
 * 960807 G - monster skills randomised a little (binomially, which is OK).
 * 971026 Belgarion - added "set_no_regenerate" (some quests stuff up when
 *		monsters wander back after death.) Yeah, I know, more hacks...
 * 981211 Jenna - set minimum for monster load_chat and load_a_chats
 * 990610 Jenna - enabled multiple catch_tell objects
 * 991217 Jenna	- began converting set_spell_mess stuff to add_attack().
 * 000309 Jenna - converted talk_ob to multiple catch_shout objects
 * 000309 Jenna - made all monsters attempt to regenerate every death
 * 000706 Jenna - added "wisdom" to monsters
 * 010221 Jenna - allowed add_store("no_enter") to prevent mobs from
 *		  wandering into certain rooms.
 * 010404 Jenna - set_move() no longer works instantly
 */

